    "title": "Should a distributor replace Tally? Usually not — here is what to do instead",
    "description": "An honest look at what Tally does well for Indian distributors, where it costs you hours every day, and why running something alongside it beats a migration you will abandon halfway.",
    "published": "2026-07-27",
